Sneak and Show combo: use Show and Tell or Sneak Attack to cheat Emrakul the Aeons Torn or Griselbrand into play far ahead of curve. Dig with Brainstorm/Ponder/Preordain to assemble enabler + fatty; protect the key spell with Force of Will and Spell Pierce. Ancient Tomb/City of Traitors power out turn-1-2 kills. Go for it when protected; Griselbrand draws to refill.
